{"flow": "spec-change-decision", "desc": "Reviewer 发现导致要改 effort spec 时, 作者的提议交一个独立会话判断; 两者不一致时由用户决定 (09).", "entry": "second", "returns": {"decided": "已决定, 回到作者执行", "stopped": "用户停止"}}
{"id": "second", "type": "agent", "desc": "新会话, 智能档不低于作者.", "work": "spec-second-opinion", "next": {"agree": "return:decided", "disagree": "ask", "ask-user": "ask"}, "write": {"scope": "read-only"}, "instruction": "作者提议因审核发现修改 effort spec (提议, 发现与依据见输入). 独立判断是否同意: 修改是否必要, 能否改为把修正收窄到 spec 允许的范围. 只给结论与理由, 不改文件.", "inputs": ["$state.dispositions", "$state.effortSpec"], "output": {"branch": ["agree", "disagree", "ask-user"], "fields": {"reason": "string"}}, "src": ["skills/commit/fix-rounds.md#2"]}
{"id": "ask", "type": "waitUser", "desc": "不一致时交用户.", "next": {"apply": "return:decided", "narrow": "return:decided", "conflict-ruling": "return:decided", "stop": "return:stopped"}, "question": "作者与独立会话对是否修改 effort spec 意见不一 (双方理由见背景). 请选择: 修改 spec, 收窄修正, 记冲突裁决, 或停止.", "options": ["apply", "narrow", "conflict-ruling", "stop"], "context": ["$state.dispositions", "$output.second.reason"], "src": ["skills/commit/fix-rounds.md#2"]}
